# Project Memory

- **Read** `.cursor/memory.md` when starting work or when project context would help.
- **Update** it when you learn something worth remembering (architecture decisions, gotchas, user preferences, conventions).
- Keep memory entries concise; append to the "Lessons Learned" section or add new sections as needed.
- Do not duplicate information already in README or config—reference those instead.
